Third-party data

This license covers the source code and documentation in this repository. It
does not cover the evaluation data under `data/eval/`, which is redistributed
from its original sources and remains under their terms:

- SIGIR 2016 cohort — from the TrialGPT project (NCBI/NLM),
  https://github.com/ncbi-nlp/TrialGPT
- TREC Clinical Trials 2021 and 2022 topics and relevance judgments — from the
  Text REtrieval Conference (NIST), https://www.trec-cds.org/

Trial records are retrieved from ClinicalTrials.gov, a service of the U.S.
National Library of Medicine.

Not a clinical decision tool. All patient notes in this repository are
synthetic. This software is a research artifact and must not be used to make
or inform decisions about the care of real patients.
